This minimal view shows text; a full host renders approvals and tool/artifact/media/status data parts too. onObservation exposes separate response/memory/graph states even after response completion.

sendMessage creates a new text intent. Retain message/request identity for replay after ambiguous submission. Use resumeStream to reconnect observation; transport.disconnect() closes only observation and transport.stop() requests run cancellation.

Body/header/metadata request overrides, non-text input and regeneration are rejected by this transport. Authentication belongs to the runtime token callback; models, context, tools and budgets belong to the published backend policy.

See API reference and advanced usage.

